<title>SINGAPORE: Thakral appoints deputy CEO.</title>
<headline>Thakral appoints deputy CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer electronics group Thakral Corp said on Tuesday it had appointed Elie Joseph Baroudi as it deputy chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Baroudi, 51, will assist in strategic planning and market positioning, a company statement said.</p>
<p>His duties also include overseeing investor relations, human resources, legal and statutory compliance as well as business development and banking.</p>
<p>Baroudi was previously executive director and Southeast Asia regional head at American Express Bank Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
